  "rules": [
    "validated must be true for every evidence item",
    "issues must be an empty list for every evidence item",
    "manifest is required for every evidence item with a dedicated validator",
    "nested manifests are validated by their dedicated evidence validators",
    "nested manifests are preferred where dedicated validators exist",
    "no manifest leaf value may contain an angle-bracket template sentinel (<...>); real evidence carries no placeholder tokens",
    "a manifest that self-reports validated:false or a non-empty issues list must not be overridden to valid by the bundle assembler"
